psi_descent.v and psi_cdindex.v get OOM-killed at 2GB cgroup limit.
Need `--mem=32G` (or more) in Slurm job allocation.

**Why:** The cgroup at `/sys/fs/cgroup/.../job_NNNN/memory.max` caps RSS regardless of node capacity. Default allocation is ~2GB.

**How to apply:** If coqc gets SIGKILL (exit 137), check the cgroup limit before debugging the proof. The node (mem001, partition=mem) has 3TB but only gives what's requested.
